{"unit_id":"icearia0219__dsh-memory-spaces#card-zh","repo":"icearia0219/dsh-memory-spaces","commit":"f276ecc859262e23f5c4f6239755df5e4f977821","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-spaces 是面向 DSH Web 会话的共享记忆插件。它使用每个 Profile 的本地 SQLite 保存命名记忆空间、来源关系和使用关系，并在会话处理前检索有效记忆。用户可通过 /memory 保存、查看和预览记忆，也可在界面选择会话及消息、导入历史摘要，并检查发送前将注入的记忆。适合希望在本地多个会话间复用决策、偏好和项目事实的用户；历史摘要使用 DSH 模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:105","src/command.ts:78","src/database.ts:273","src/history-import.ts:120"]}
{"unit_id":"icearia0219__dsh-memory-spaces#card-en","repo":"icearia0219/dsh-memory-spaces","commit":"f276ecc859262e23f5c4f6239755df5e4f977821","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memory-spaces adds shared memory to DSH Web sessions. It stores versioned memories in local SQLite and recalls matches before a session step. Users can manage, preview, and select memories, and optionally summarize session history. It helps reuse decisions and project facts across sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:105","src/command.ts:78","src/database.ts:273","src/history-import.ts:120"]}
